  "old": "<h2 id=\"adhd-apps-compared\">How do the 40 apps we reviewed compare?</h2>\n<p>Every app below has a full review on FOCO, and its name links to it. Prices come from each review's at-a-glance table, so check the review for the date and the full price list.</p>\n<div class=\"foco-table-wrap foco-cmp2 multi\">\n<table>\n<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"cm-label\">App and price</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"cm-label\">Best for</span></th><th scope=\"col\"><span class=\"cm-label\">Platforms</span></th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"cm-ours\"><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-foco.png\" alt=\"FOCO app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/\">FOCO</a></b><small>$59/year with a 7-day free trial, or $9/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Starting the task you keep putting off (the app we make)</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-aligned.png\" alt=\"Aligned app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/aligned-app-review/\">Aligned</a></b><small>Free download; coaching from $9.99/week</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Talking through overwhelm and getting one place to start</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Mac, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-appblock.png\" alt=\"AppBlock app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/appblock-review/\">AppBlock</a></b><small>Free plan; Premium from $4.99/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Blocking distracting phone apps and sites on a schedule</td><