td data-label=\"Platforms\">Android, iPhone, iPad, browser</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-bepresent.png\" alt=\"BePresent app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/bepresent-app-review/\">BePresent</a></b><small>Free download; mostly $59.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">People motivated by streaks, friends and rewards</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-bloom.png\" alt=\"Bloom app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/bloom-app-blocker-review/\">Bloom</a></b><small>Card $39 to $69 once; app free</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">People who override software limits</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-brain-fm.png\" alt=\"Brain.fm app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/brain-fm-review/\">Brain.fm</a></b><small>$14.99/month or $99.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Background music for work, study and sleep</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Web, iPhone, iPad, Android, desktop</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-brainrot.png\" alt=\"Brainrot app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/brainrot-app-review/\">Brainrot</a></b><small>From $3.99/month or $19.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Doomscrolling, with a character to keep you honest</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-brainway.png\" alt=\"Brainway app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/brainway-app-review/\">Brainway</a></b><small>Subscription: $29.99 or $59.99</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Tracking which habits and moods line up with your procrastination</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-brick.png\" alt=\"Brick app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/brick-app-review/\">Brick</a></b><small>$59 device; app free</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Putting real distance between you and your feed</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-chillio.png\" alt=\"Chillio app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/chillio-app-review/\">Chillio</a></b><small>$19.99/month or $89.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Small daily habits, chores and short wellbeing lessons</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-clarify.png\" alt=\"Clarify app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/clarify-app-review/\">Clarify</a></b><small>$19.99/month or from $39.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Timed to-do lists with an immersive focus timer</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-cold-turkey-v2.png\" alt=\"Cold Turkey Blocker app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/cold-turkey-blocker-review/\">Cold Turkey Blocker</a></b><small>Free; Pro $45 once</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Hard blocks on a computer that you cannot talk yourself out of</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Windows, Mac</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-ellie.jpg\" alt=\"Ellie app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/ellie-planner-review/\">Ellie</a></b><small>Free plan; Pro $9.99/month or $99.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Brain dump, then time-block a realistic day</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Mac, Windows, web</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-endel.png\" alt=\"Endel app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/endel-app-review/\">Endel</a></b><small>Free edition; $19.99/month or $119.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Background sound for focus and falling asleep</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple Watch, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-fabulous.png\" alt=\"Fabulous app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/fabulous-app-review/\">Fabulous</a></b><small>Free basics; Premium $16.99 to $59.99</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Building morning, afternoon and evening routines</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android, web</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-finch.png\" alt=\"Finch app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/finch-app-review/\">Finch</a></b><small>Free; optional Plus</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Small self-care goals with a pet, and no penalty</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-flow-club.png\" alt=\"Flow Club app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/flow-club-review/\">Flow Club</a></b><small>$40/month or $400/year; 7-day trial</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Hosted group coworking on video, booked ahead</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Computer, in the browser</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-focus-friend.jpg\" alt=\"Focus Friend app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/focus-friend-app-review/\">Focus Friend</a></b><small>Free; Pro $3.99/month or $19.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Staying in a focus session with a companion</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Mac, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-focusmate.png\" alt=\"Focusmate app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/focusmate-review/\">Focusmate</a></b><small>3 free sessions a week; Plus $8 to $12/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Accountability with one other person, by video</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Web</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-habitica.png\" alt=\"Habitica app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/habitica-review/\">Habitica</a></b><small>Free; optional subscription</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Turning habits and chores into a game</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Web, iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-habitify.png\" alt=\"Habitify app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/habitify-review/\">Habitify</a></b><small>Free for 3 habits; Plus $29.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Tracking a handful of daily habits with reminders and charts</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple Watch, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-inflow.png\" alt=\"Inflow app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/inflow-review/\">Inflow</a></b><small>$22.49/month or $95.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Learning ADHD coping skills through a CBT-based program</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-joon.png\" alt=\"Joon app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/joon-app-review/\">Joon</a></b><small>Free version; $12.99/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Parents who want a game to motivate a child with daily routines</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iOS, Android, Fire, Chromebook</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-liven.png\" alt=\"Liven app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/liven-app-review/\">Liven</a></b><small>$7.99/week to $89.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Talking emotions through with an AI coach</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-llama-life.png\" alt=\"Llama Life app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/llama-life-review/\">Llama Life</a></b><small>$6/month or $39/year after a 7-day trial</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">A countdown on every task, one task at a time</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Web, iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-lofi-town.png\" alt=\"Lofi Town app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/lofi-town-review/\">Lofi Town</a></b><small>Free; Supporter from $2.99/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">A cozy multiplayer study room in your browser</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Browser</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-mindflow.jpg\" alt=\"Mindflow AI app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/mindflow-ai-review/\">Mindflow AI</a></b><small>Premium from $17.99/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Talking through ADHD struggles with an AI coach</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-numo.jpg\" alt=\"Numo app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/numo-app-review/\">Numo</a></b><small>Plans from $7.99 to $59.99</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Getting tasks done with ADHD peers cheering you on</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-opal.png\" alt=\"Opal app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/opal-app-review/\">Opal</a></b><small>Free plan; Pro $19.99/month or $99.99/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Blocking apps on a schedule without buying a device</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">iPhone, Android, Mac</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-pomofocus.png\" alt=\"Pomofocus app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/pomofocus-app-review/\">Pomofocus</a></b><small>Free; Premium $3/month or $18/year</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">A no-setup Pomodoro timer at your desk</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Browser, Mac, Windows, Linux</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/app-icon-reclaim.png\" alt=\"Reclaim AI app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/reclaim-ai-review/\">Reclaim AI</a></b><small>Free plan; from $10/month</small></span></span></th><td data-label=\"Best for\">Protecting focus time on a busy work calendar</td><td data-label=\"Platforms\">Web, with Google Calendar or Outlook</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\"><span class=\"cm-app\"><img src=\"https://www.tryfoco.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/app-icon-recordo.png\" alt=\"Recordo app icon\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" loading=\"lazy\"/><span><b><a href=\"https: